1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,875
W: Dennis, I'm taking the train to Piedmont tomorrow.

2
00:00:03,795 --> 00:00:07,365
Do you happen to know where the taxi stand at the station is?

3
00:00:08,110 --> 00:00:13,015
M: It used to be in front of the exit on the northern side of the building, but it's being renovated.

4
00:00:13,995 --> 00:00:15,375
So head to the eastern side instead.

5
00:00:16,190 --> 00:00:16,935
W: Thanks for the information.

6
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:20,535
I need to catch a cab to get to my client's office.

7
00:00:21,735 --> 00:00:25,075
M: Will you spend the night there or take the train back after your meeting's done?

8
00:00:25,715 --> 00:00:27,795
W: I'll probably stay there for the night.

9
00:00:28,255 --> 00:00:31,650
You wouldn't happen to know any good places to eat there, would you?

10
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:32,735
M: I know some.

11
00:00:33,535 --> 00:00:36,165
I'll e-mail you the details when I get back to my office.
